&lt;p class=&quot;block___NY-qf paragraph___LIXe0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;block___NY-qf list___9IR08 orderedList___Lej9D&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;listItem___pn9uW&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;block___NY-qf paragraph___LIXe0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ZH→EN Transcreation &amp;amp; Quality Assurance&lt;/strong&gt;: Rewrite storylines, character dialogue, event and quest copy, and UI text from Simplified Chinese into natural, idiomatic English, faithfully recreating tone, emotion, humor, pacing, and character voice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;listItem___pn9uW&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;block___NY-qf paragraph___LIXe0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Linguistic Asset Management&lt;/strong&gt;: Build and maintain terminology databases, style guides, character voice profiles, naming conventions, and translation memories to ensure consistent style across versions and chapters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;listItem___pn9uW&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;block___NY-qf paragraph___LIXe0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Review &amp;amp; Standardization&lt;/strong&gt;: Review output from internal and external translators, provide specific and actionable revision suggestions, and distill individual judgment into reusable team standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;listItem___pn9uW&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;block___NY-qf paragraph___LIXe0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LQA &amp;amp; Delivery Assurance&lt;/strong&gt;: Organize in-game language quality assurance across development and live-operation builds; identify, classify, track, and verify issue resolution to closure, delivering on schedule in sync with release cadence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;listItem___pn9uW&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;block___NY-qf paragraph___LIXe0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;: Work with design, narrative, art, publishing, and other teams to proactively flag cultural sensitivities from the target-market perspective, ensuring cultural adaptation is addressed at early stages.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;block___NY-qf paragraph___LIXe0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;block___NY-qf list___9IR08 orderedList___Lej9D&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;listItem___pn9uW&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;block___NY-qf paragraph___LIXe0&quot;&gt;Native or near-native English speaker with a solid foundation in writing, editing, and proofreading; fluent in reading and writing Chinese, able to directly comprehend and interpret nuances in the Chinese source text.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;listItem___pn9uW&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;block___NY-qf paragraph___LIXe0&quot;&gt;3+ years of experience in game localization or a related field; must have been involved end-to-end in the launch and ongoing live-ops updates of at least one long-term operated title.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;listItem___pn9uW&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;block___NY-qf paragraph___LIXe0&quot;&gt;Familiarity with the full localization workflow and tooling: CAT/TMS, terminology management, translation memory, LQA processes, and defect management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;listItem___pn9uW&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;block___NY-qf paragraph___LIXe0&quot;&gt;Strong cultural sensitivity and editorial judgment — not satisfied with literal translation; able to propose better idiomatic rewrites and articulate the rationale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;listItem___pn9uW&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;block___NY-qf paragraph___LIXe0&quot;&gt;Excellent communication and scheduling skills; comfortable working in cross-cultural team environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
