&lt;p&gt;NetEase’s ESG initiatives are among the best in the global media and entertainment industry, earning it a distinction as one of the S&amp;amp;P Global Industry Movers and an “A” rating from MSCI. For more information, please visit:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://ir.netease.com/&quot;&gt;http://ir.netease.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview：&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;NetEase is a globally renowned game developer and publisher. As a core business unit under NetEase, the Game Application and Platform Development Group consistently explores new opportunities and technological innovations across the gaming ecosystem and the broader internet industry. We have launched a suite of industry-leading, award-winning products favored by massive global user groups. Our flagship products for the Chinese market include UU Booster, MuMu Player, BUFF Market and UU Remote. We are also aggressively expanding our global footprint, exploring innovative AI Agent technologies and launching a wide range of well-received gaming tools and trading platforms for overseas users. Focused on the development of commercial internet applications, our team serves the worldwide gaming community with a cumulative user base of hundreds of millions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities：&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and iterate on features for our Android productivity applications, completing module-level development tasks under guidance from senior engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn and implement the modern Android development tech stack including Kotlin, Jetpack components and Jetpack Compose&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gradually take full ownership of independent feature modules and deliver end-to-end feature implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in code reviews, technical seminars and the implementation of team engineering best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cooperate with product managers and UI/UX designers to sort out user requirements, clarify development demands and convert business needs into feasible technical solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor application runtime performance and stability; assist in troubleshooting and resolving online production failures&lt;/li&gt;
